{"id":"darum","lemma":"darum","pos":"adv","rank":286,"glosses":["around it, around that","therefore, for that reason","because! (non-answer to questions one does not wish to answer)"],"ipa":"/ˈdaːʁʊm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0d/De-darum.ogg/De-darum.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Darum liebe ich dich.","en":"That's why I love you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566047","words":[null,{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"du"}]},{"text":"Kannst du dich darum kümmern?","en":"Can you deal with it?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"to take care"}]},{"text":"Können wir uns morgen darum kümmern?","en":"Can we take care of that tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"tomorrow"},null,{"g":"to take care"}]},{"text":"Lass mich mich darum kümmern.","en":"Leave it to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/32049","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"to take care"}]},{"text":"Ich kümmere mich darum.","en":"I care about that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392492","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take care","l":"kümmern"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null]}]}